A '''Wither Scroll in a Bottle''' is a {{Legendary}} consumable. It can be obatined from the [[Raffle of the Century]] during Year 500.

== Obtaining ==
A '''Wither Scroll in a Bottle''' is a {{Red|'''MAJOR'''}} reward from the Year 500 [[Raffle of the Century]].

== Usage ==
Consuming a '''Wither Scroll in a Bottle''' plays an animation and rewards the player randomly with one of the following items: 
{{RL|1 Implosion|1 Shadow Warp|1 Wither Shield}}
